class=\"accordion-header u_item_expandable bg-grey\">\n                                                <button class=\"accordion-button collapsed\" type=\"button\"\n                                                    data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-target=\"#u_item_question_3-2\"\n                                                    aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"u_item_question_3-2\">\n                                                    <div class=\"containers\">Comment l’utiliser<\/div>\n                                                <\/button>\n                                            <\/h2>\n                                            <div id=\"u_item_question_3-2\" class=\"accordion-collapse collapse\"\n                                                data-bs-parent=\"#accordionQuesExample_3\">\n                                                <div class=\"accordion-body\">\n                                                    <div class=\"containers\">\n                                                        <div class=\"accordion_list li_decimal\">\n                                                            <ul>\n                                                                <li>Suis simplement les instructions pour installer\n                                                                    l’appareil sur ton robinet.<\/li>\n                                                                <li>Trouve les bons adaptateurs pour ton robinet ou\n                                                                    utilise l’universel.<\/li>\n                                                                <li>Remplace le filtre tous les 3 mois.<\/li>\n                                                            <\/ul>\n                                                        <\/div>\n                                                        <div class=\"accordion_icon_list\">\n                                                            <ul>\n            