n                                                    <\/div>\n                                                <\/div>\n                                            <\/div>\n                                        <\/div>\n                                        <div class=\"accordion-item u_item_question bg-grey\">\n                                            <h2 class=\"accordion-header u_item_expandable bg-grey\">\n                                                <button class=\"accordion-button collapsed\" type=\"button\"\n                                                    data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-target=\"#u_item_question_4-2\"\n                                                    aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"u_item_question_4-2\">\n                                                    <div class=\"containers\">Comment l’utiliser<\/div>\n                                                <\/button>\n                                            <\/h2>\n                                            <div id=\"u_item_question_4-2\" class=\"accordion-collapse collapse\"\n                                                data-bs-parent=\"#accordionQuesExample_4\">\n                                                <div class=\"accordion-body\">\n                                                    <div class=\"containers\">\n                                                        <div class=\"accordion_list li_decimal\">\n                                                            <ul>\n                                                                <li>\n                                                                    Nettoie et sèche ta peau pour la préparer à une\n                                                                    absorption optimale de la lumière LED. Fixe l’appareil\n                                                                    autour de ton cou avec les sangles velcro réglables.\n                                                  